### GRAPHQL TESTS

### 1. GraphQL - Get All Hotels with Cities
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "query GetHotels { hotels { id name city } }"
}

### 2. GraphQL - Get Hotel with Rooms
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "query GetHotelWithRooms { hotel(id: \"hotel-1\") { id name city rooms { id name capacity pricePerNight } } }"
}

### 3. GraphQL - Get Rooms for Hotel
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "query GetRooms { rooms(hotelId: \"hotel-1\") { id name capacity pricePerNight isAvailable } }"
}

### 4. GraphQL - Get Room with Availability (no dates)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "query GetRoom { room(id: \"room-101\") { id name capacity pricePerNight isAvailable } }"
}

### 5. GraphQL - Get Room Availability (specific dates)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "query GetRoomAvailability { room(id: \"room-101\") { id name isAvailable(checkIn: \"2026-03-25\", checkOut: \"2026-03-27\") } }"
}

### 6. GraphQL - Get Bookings for Room
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "query GetBookings { bookings(roomId: \"room-101\") { id roomId checkIn checkOut status room { id name } } }"
}

### 7. GraphQL - Get Single Booking
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "query GetBooking { booking(id: \"booking-1\") { id roomId checkIn checkOut status room { id name } } }"
}

### 8. GraphQL - Create Booking Mutation
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation CreateBooking { createBooking(roomId: \"room-202\", checkIn: \"2026-04-05\", checkOut: \"2026-04-07\") { id roomId checkIn checkOut status } }"
}

### 9. GraphQL - Confirm Booking
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation ConfirmBooking { confirmBooking(bookingId: \"booking-1\") }"
}

### 10. GraphQL - Cancel Booking
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation CancelBooking { cancelBooking(bookingId: \"booking-4\") }"
}